{"quest":{"line_id":"12010521","line_type":"5","order":270,"title":{"cn":"日常供货","en":"Daily Supply","jp":"日常供給","kr":"일일 공급"},"description":{"cn":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""},"reputation_camp_id":"201","reputation_camp_title":{"cn":"水鬼帮","en":"Water Wights","jp":"海のギャング","kr":"물귀신파"},"route":"#/season-2/daily/12010521","assets":[{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010521:1:1"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12236010"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010521:1:2"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12236020"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010521:1:3"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12236030"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010521:1:4"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12236040"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12236050"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010521:1:5"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12236060"},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010521:1:6"},{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12236070"}],"tasks":[{"task_id":"1","steps":[{"step_id":"1","pre_step_ids":[],"objective_title":{"cn":"问问阿尔近况","en":"Check on Al","jp":"アルに近況を尋ねる","kr":"아르의 근황 묻기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"阿尔等人扬言要在锈锚港重新开始，去看看他们是否需要帮助。","en":"Al and his crew say they want a fresh start in Rustport. Go see if they need assistance.","jp":"アルたちは、街でまた一から始めるのだと豪語していた。何か手伝うことはないか様子を見に行こう。","kr":"아르 일행이 러스트 항에서 새출발을 다짐했다. 혹시 도움이 필요하지 않은지 확인해 보자."}},{"step_id":"2","pre_step_ids":["1"],"objective_title":{"cn":"去钓苔鲤的水边","en":"Go to Fishing Spot","jp":"モスカープを釣りに行く","kr":"낚시 포인트로 가기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"水鬼帮阿尔说托你的福，终于赚了点钱。但有顾客抱怨鱼不新鲜，他托你去钓肥美的苔鲤和鲜嫩的雨珍珠。","en":"The Water Wights tell Al that, thanks to you, they finally made some money. However, some customers complain that the fish isn't fresh, so he asks you to catch some grass carp and rainpearls.","jp":"アルはようやく稼げるようになった。しかし一部の客人が、魚が新鮮ではないと苦情を寄せているようだ。彼はあなたに、肥えたモスカープと新鮮なパールレインを釣ってくるよう頼んだ。","kr":"내 덕분에 드디어 돈을 만지게 된 물귀신파 아르는 어느 손님이 물고기가 신선하지 않다며 불평했다며 통통한 이끼 잉어와 신선한 레인펄을 낚아달라고 부탁했다."}},{"step_id":"3","pre_step_ids":["2"],"objective_title":{"cn":"钓鱼","en":"Fishing","jp":"釣り","kr":"낚시"},"objective_description":{"cn":"你来到了钓苔鲤的位置，开始钓鱼吧。","en":"You arrive at the spot to catch grass carp. Start fishing!","jp":"モスカープの釣りポイントに到着した。釣りを開始しよう。","kr":"이끼 잉어를 낚을 수 있는 곳에 도착했다. 낚시를 시작하자."}},{"step_id":"4","pre_step_ids":["3"],"objective_title":{"cn":"去钓雨珍珠的水边","en":"Go to Fishing Spot","jp":"パールレインを釣りに行く","kr":"낚시 포인트로 가기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"钓完苔鲤，还有雨珍珠，去下一个钓鱼的地方吧。","en":"You have caught some grass carp. Now, head to the next fishing spot to catch some rainpearls.","jp":"モスカープが釣れたら、次はパールレインだ。次の釣りポイントに向かおう。","kr":"이끼 잉어를 다 낚았으니 이제 레인펄이 남았다. 다음 낚시 포인트로 이동하자."}},{"step_id":"5","pre_step_ids":["4"],"objective_title":{"cn":"钓鱼","en":"Fishing","jp":"釣り","kr":"낚시"},"objective_description":{"cn":"你来到了钓雨珍珠的位置，开始钓鱼吧。","en":"You arrive at the spot to catch rainpearls. Start fishing!","jp":"パールレインの釣りポイントに到着した。釣りを開始しよう。","kr":"레인펄을 낚을 수 있는 곳에 도착했다. 낚시를 시작하자."}},{"step_id":"6","pre_step_ids":["5"],"objective_title":{"cn":"回去找阿尔","en":"Return to Al","jp":"アルのところに戻る","kr":"아르에게 돌아가기"},"objective_description":{"cn":"成功钓到了肥美的苔鲤和鲜嫩的雨珍珠，回去找阿尔交鱼吧。","en":"You've managed to catch some plump grass carp and fresh rainpearls, so head back to Al with the fish.","jp":"肥えたモスカープと新鮮なパールレインを釣り上げた。戻ってアルに渡そう。","kr":"통통한 이끼 잉어와 신선한 레인펄을 낚았다. 돌아가서 아르에게 건네주자."}}]}],"archive_scope":"Configured faction daily paths. Live assignment, NPC visibility and minigame/battle success are not simulated.","source_plot_joins":[{"plot":"12236010","asset":"ep2/quest_story_12236010","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep2/quest_story_12236010.asset","raw_sha256":"ec13a03bb32dae7342e36edcd52e95a39c7954253cf4eb18a1364b7f7cd75a8c","lpak":"binary_NodeCanvas_DialogueTree_17859706585472604641.lpak","offset":9801784,"size":1504,"identity":"12010521:1:1","field":"verified_npc_task_menu"},{"plot":"12236020","asset":"ep2/quest_story_12236020","resource":"nodecanvas/dialoguetree/ep2/quest_story_12236020.asset","raw_sha256":"0a5f45ddd12b2697f30d34944c1b18e22f223c86f94ccc835fb3aaa77ea9