出在死潮舰队实验室弄到的药粉命令阿尔给帕斯和梭罗服下，阿尔不从，两方爆发争斗。","summary_i18n":{"cn":"雷纳塔因为认出了你迟迟不露面，阿尔和你决定执行演戏方案，见你被“俘虏”，雷纳塔终于现身。他拿出在死潮舰队实验室弄到的药粉命令阿尔给帕斯和梭罗服下，阿尔不从，两方爆发争斗。","en":"You pretend to be Al's captive to lure Renata out. She demands Paz and Thoreau eat the powder from the Dead Tide lab. A conflict breaks out when Al refuses.","jp":"あなたの正体に気づいたレナータはなかなか姿を見せない。そこでアルとあなたは一芝居打ってみた。「捕虜」となったあなたを見て、レナータはようやく現れた。そして彼女は、死海の艦隊の実験室で入手した粉末をアルに渡し、パースとソローで効果を試すよう命令する。しかしアルはこれを拒否、二組のギャングの間で争いが勃発する。","kr":"레나타는 나를 알아보고 한참 모습을 드러내지 않았고 아르와 나는 계획한 연극을 시작했다. 내가 “포로”로 잡혔다고 생각한 레나타가 드디어 모습을 드러냈다! 죽음의 함대 실험실에서 얻은 가루를 꺼낸 레나타는 파스와 솔로에게 먹이라고 아르를 향해 명령했지만, 그가 거부하면서 싸움이 벌어졌다."},"summary_status":{"cn":"aligned_plot_summary","en":"aligned_plot_summary","jp":"aligned_plot_summary","kr":"aligned_plot_summary"},"metadata_source":"story_metadata_generated","summary_match_status":"aligned_exact_unique","summary_record_indices":[23487],"summary_record_index":23487,"sequence_index":754,"logical_collection":"season_2","logical_chapter":"season_2","logical_story_kind":"daily_quest","exploration_line_id":"12010521","quest_title_i18n":{"cn":"日常供货","en":"Daily Supply","jp":"日常供給","kr":"일일 공급"},"quest_summary_i18n":{"cn":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""},"optional_activity":true,"sequence_source":"exploration_task_graph","daily_source":{"step":"12010521:1:1","dispatch":"verified_npc_task_menu","plot":"12236010"}},{"asset_key":"optional/objective_12010521:1:2","graph":"optional_activities/graphs/12010521/1/2.json","locales":{"cn":"optional_activities/locales/cn/12010521/1/2.json","en":"optional_activities/locales/en/12010521/1/2.json","jp":"optional_activities/locales/jp/12010521/1/2.json","kr":"optional_activities/locales/kr/12010521/1/2.json"},"stats":{"node_count":1,"text_entry_count":0},"logical_collection":"season_2","logical_chapter":"season_2","logical_story_kind":"daily_quest","exploration_line_id":"12010521","quest_title_i18n":{"cn":"日常供货","en":"Daily Supply","jp":"日常供給","kr":"일일 공급"},"quest_summary_i18n":{"cn":"","en"